        <Param val="Instructions&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this task, you will be shown a road-crossing situation.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Your task is to observe the traffic and pedestrians carefully and decide when and how to cross the road.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- Use the C and W keys to indicate your crossing decisions, according to the key instructions provided.&amp;#10;- Respond as accurately and as quickly as possible.&amp;#10;- Pay attention to the movement of vehicles and pedestrians.&amp;#10;- Complete the practice trials before beginning the main experiment.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press the SPACEBAR to continue." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
        <Param val="from exp settings" valType="str" updates="None" name="units"/>
